/T (180 Degrees Consulting UC Davis is a student-run pro-bono consulting chapter connecting nonprofits and social enterprises with motivated student consulting teams. We operate in the Yolo County and Sacramento area. Working with organizations such as food banks, animal shelters, and environmental non-profits, as well as socially motivated organizations.)
/E (180 Degrees Consulting UC Davis is a student-run pro-bono consulting chapter connecting nonprofits and social enterprises with motivated student consulting teams. We operate in the Yolo County and Sacramento area. Working with organizations such as food banks, animal shelters, and environmental non-profits, as well as socially motivated organizations.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
