105 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 64 0 R
/T (We seek to improve local non-profits in the Yolo  County and Sacramento region through proposing and implementing tailored and thoughtful business strategy solutions. We aim to create a group of driven, passionate, and professional students who care about cultivating culture and producing quality work beyond the resume. We pride ourselves in delivering excellent work that goes above and beyond expectations. We seek to understand our clients to the fullest degree and adopt a humble approach to improving the organizations we work with. )
